# Copy to ~/.config/agent-auth/env.refs and enable only the references needed
# by this harness. Values must be literal op://vault/item/field references.
# Store actual credentials in a dedicated vault accessible by the service
# account. Built-in Personal / Private / Employee / default Shared vaults
# cannot be granted to service accounts.
#
# GITHUB_PAT=op://Agents/GitHub Codex MCP/token
# YUI_MCP_TOKEN=op://Agents/YUI MCP/token
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=op://Agents/Anthropic/api-key
# OPENAI_API_KEY=op://Agents/OpenAI/api-key
#
# Claude Code / Codex subscription logins do not need API keys here.
# Do not put OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN or shell/interpreter settings here.
